   "date": "2022-12-20",
   "text": "Anti-Corruption and Public Integrity Act\n This bill addresses issues of public integrity, ethics, conflicts of interest, lobbying, rulemaking, and judicial ethics. For example, the bill limits federal hiring of former registered lobbyists and establishes divestment requirements for senior government officials."
